Rebuild: crewcut commit df54b3a (`dev`), `scripts/reproduce.sh`, log `record/results/reproduce-run1.log`, data `record/results/comparison.json`. A second full run from an empty directory reproduced shots/dialogue/hierarchy byte-for-byte and every task json/csv/README byte-for-byte (sha256 compared).

| Item | Result |
